                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A modified arm of any of several male cephalopods that functions as a reproductive organ by transferring sperm to the mantle of the female."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61b23c1c-113c-486e-ab4d-ec0d777bb20b",
                                                "sense_id": "77a2d178-bf32-3411-aab2-37f197c5ec66",
                                                "text": "When not in use, the male's hectocotylus hides in a pouch, leaving him to go about his business with only seven arms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e8df973-a4b9-4aab-bb31-ba3ce776c00b",
                                                "sense_id": "77a2d178-bf32-3411-aab2-37f197c5ec66",
                                                "text": "The hectocotylus, like many other genitals, is made of soft tissues which are unlikely to be fossilised."
                                            }
